{
    "title": "CCC: The Mystery of Caddy",
    "description": "Meet Emma and her friend Elliot. As members of the Curious\r\nCritters Club, they are dedicated to the task of discovering new\r\ncritters for science. Sometimes the creatures turn out to be\r\nextraordinary!\r\n\r\nOne day by Cadboro Bay, Emma and Elliot hear of recent sightings\r\nof Caddy the sea monster. It's not long before the two curious\r\nadventurous are hot on the trail. Along the way, they encounter\r\nother curious creatures, some of them with harmful intentions\r\ntowards Caddy. Luckily Emma and Elliot are there to help save the\r\nday.\r\n\r\nThis exciting interactive book is loaded with interactivity, animation,\r\nmusic and sound on every page. It also features a range of options\r\nwhich allows you to experience the book in a style that suits you\r\nbest.\r\n\r\nSTORY HIGHLIGHTS\r\n\r\n\u2022 Your interactions drives the story forward\r\n\u2022 Tilt your device for a 3D parallax effect\r\n\u2022 Words appear as they are narrated\r\n\u2022 Fantastic illustrations and animation\r\n\u2022 Original music and sound\r\n\u2022 Story told by Canadian performer, Maya Khammany\r\n\u2022 Narration options: English and French\r\n\u2022 Toggle narration, text and audio\r\n\u2022 App is free-to-play, optimised for phones and tablets\r\n\u2022 Intuitive, kid-friendly navigation\r\n\r\nCHILD FRIENDLY\r\n\r\n\u2022 Parental controls\r\n\u2022 No advertisements\r\n\u2022 No in-app purchases\r\n\u2022 No location data collected\r\n\u2022 No social links\r\n\r\nCURIOUS CRITTERS CLUB - THE SERIES\r\n\r\nFind more FREE Curious Critters Club stories and AR, online\r\ngames at:\r\nwww.curiouscrittersclub.com\r\n\r\nCreated by Yoozoo ltd and La bo\u00eete \u00e0 pitons.\r\nMade with the assistance of NZ On Air and the Canadian Media\r\nFund.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Meet Emma and her friend Elliot. As members of the Curious<br>Critters Club, they are dedicated to the task of discovering new<br>critters for science. Sometimes the creatures turn out to be<br>extraordinary!<br><br>One day by Cadboro Bay, Emma and Elliot hear of recent sightings<br>of Caddy the sea monster. It&#39;s not long before the two curious<br>adventurous are hot on the trail. Along the way, they encounter<br>other curious creatures, some of them with harmful intentions<br>towards Caddy. Luckily Emma and Elliot are there to help save the<br>day.<br><br>This exciting interactive book is loaded with interactivity, animation,<br>music and sound on every page. It also features a range of options<br>which allows you to experience the book in a style that suits you<br>best.<br><br>STORY HIGHLIGHTS<br><br>\u2022 Your interactions drives the story forward<br>\u2022 Tilt your device for a 3D parallax effect<br>\u2022 Words appear as they are narrated<br>\u2022 Fantastic illustrations and animation<br>\u2022 Original music and sound<br>\u2022 Story told by Canadian performer, Maya Khammany<br>\u2022 Narration options: English and French<br>\u2022 Toggle narration, text and audio<br>\u2022 App is free-to-play, optimised for phones and tablets<br>\u2022 Intuitive, kid-friendly navigation<br><br>CHILD FRIENDLY<br><br>\u2022 Parental controls<br>\u2022 No advertisements<br>\u2022 No in-app purchases<br>\u2022 No location data collected<br>\u2022 No social links<br><br>CURIOUS CRITTERS CLUB - THE SERIES<br><br>Find more FREE Curious Critters Club stories and AR, online<br>games at:<br>www.curiouscrittersclub.com<br><br>Created by Yoozoo ltd and La bo\u00eete \u00e0 pitons.<br>Made with the assistance of NZ On Air and the Canadian Media<br>Fund.",
